  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p>재과만 카톡 오픈채팅방에서</p><p>이가은 선생님께서 추천해주신</p><p>차이나는 클라스 영상입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>생명과학1 중추신경계 뇌 수업에서</p><p>학생들과 시청해도 좋습니다.</p><p>(이제 뇌의 구조와 기능을 단순 암기하고 끝내지 않겠습니다!)&#160;&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kg5cXUVCNJw\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kg5cXUVCNJw</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kg5cXUVCNJw\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/hLeUO/hyOJvwycPy/V5HMVhHwIdckEBIaqIVOY1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=40_130_1052_376\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Kg5cXUVCNJw\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VhIOa4V2if4\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VhIOa4V2if4</a>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VhIOa4V2if4\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"868\" data-video-height=\"488\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/sSVcY/hyOJs7EptQ/FeOVVNyT5nox5kbDyHOjf0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=742_204_946_426\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"868\" data-video-origin-height=\"488\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VhIOa4V2if4\" width=\"868\" height=\"488\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=